msgid "ReliefMath 命令范围"
msgstr "ReliefMath Command Scope"

msgid ""
"本表定义工具目录和编辑核心识别的首版数学命令。表中“支持”表示目录提供可编辑插入项，或编辑核心明确识别该语法；当前 host renderer 已对 "
"``tests/fixtures/reliefmath/formulas.tsv`` 中的 131 个目录样例完成真实渲染。首版不是完整 "
"TeX/LaTeX 实现。"
msgstr ""
"This table defines the first-version mathematical commands recognized by the"
" tool catalog and editing core. Supported means the catalog offers an "
"editable insertion item or the editing core explicitly recognizes the "
"syntax. The current host renderer has actually rendered all 131 catalog "
"examples in ``tests/fixtures/reliefmath/formulas.tsv``. The first version is"
" not a complete TeX/LaTeX implementation."

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\alpha``、``\\beta``、``\\gamma``、``\\delta``、``\\epsilon``、``\\varepsilon``、``\\zeta``、``\\eta``、``\\theta``、``\\vartheta``、``\\iota``、``\\kappa``、``\\lambda``、``\\mu``、``\\nu``、``\\xi``、Unicode"
" "
"``ο``、``\\pi``、``\\varpi``、``\\rho``、``\\varrho``、``\\sigma``、``\\varsigma``、``\\tau``、``\\upsilon``、``\\phi``、``\\varphi``、``\\chi``、``\\psi``、``\\omega``、``\\Gamma``、``\\Delta``、``\\Theta``、``\\Lambda``、``\\Xi``、``\\Pi``、``\\Sigma``、``\\Upsilon``、``\\Phi``、``\\Psi``、``\\Omega``;"
" 参数：无；可与普通数学表达式组合; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：Omicron 使用 Unicode 字符，因为 TeX 没有标准 "
"``\\omicron`` 命令; 示例：``\\alpha + \\Gamma``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\alpha``, ``\\beta``, ``\\gamma``, ``\\delta``, "
"``\\epsilon``, ``\\varepsilon``, ``\\zeta``, ``\\eta``, ``\\theta``, "
"``\\vartheta``, ``\\iota``, ``\\kappa``, ``\\lambda``, ``\\mu``, ``\\nu``, "
"``\\xi``, Unicode ``ο``, ``\\pi``, ``\\varpi``, ``\\rho``, ``\\varrho``, "
"``\\sigma``, ``\\varsigma``, ``\\tau``, ``\\upsilon``, ``\\phi``, "
"``\\varphi``, ``\\chi``, ``\\psi``, ``\\omega``, ``\\Gamma``, ``\\Delta``, "
"``\\Theta``, ``\\Lambda``, ``\\Xi``, ``\\Pi``, ``\\Sigma``, ``\\Upsilon``, "
"``\\Phi``, ``\\Psi``, ``\\Omega``; Parameters: None; can be combined with "
"ordinary mathematical expressions; Math environment: inline, display; "
"Supported: yes; Limitations: Omicron uses a Unicode character because TeX "
"has no standard ``\\omicron`` command; Example: ``\\alpha + \\Gamma``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``+``、``-``、``=``、``\\pm``、``\\mp``、``\\times``、``\\cdot``、``\\div``、``\\star``;"
" 参数：无; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：运算符本身不创建占位符; 示例：``a \\times b``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``+``, ``-``, ``=``, ``\\pm``, ``\\mp``, ``\\times``, "
"``\\cdot``, ``\\div``, ``\\star``; Parameters: None; Math environment: "
"inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: Operators themselves do not "
"create placeholders; Example: ``a \\times b``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``<``、``>``、``\\le``、``\\ge``、``\\ne``、``\\approx``、``\\equiv``、``\\sim``、``\\propto``、``\\ll``、``\\gg``、``\\perp``、``\\parallel``;"
" 参数：无; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：仅列出的关系符命令; 示例：``x \\le y``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``<``, ``>``, ``\\le``, ``\\ge``, ``\\ne``, ``\\approx``, "
"``\\equiv``, ``\\sim``, ``\\propto``, ``\\ll``, ``\\gg``, ``\\perp``, "
"``\\parallel``; Parameters: None; Math environment: inline, display; "
"Supported: yes; Limitations: Only the listed relation commands; Example: ``x"
" \\le y``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\to``、``\\leftarrow``、``\\rightarrow``、``\\leftrightarrow``、``\\Rightarrow``、``\\Leftarrow``、``\\mapsto``;"
" 参数：无; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：仅列出的箭头命令; 示例：``x \\mapsto f(x)``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\to``, ``\\leftarrow``, ``\\rightarrow``, "
"``\\leftrightarrow``, ``\\Rightarrow``, ``\\Leftarrow``, ``\\mapsto``; "
"Parameters: None; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; "
"Limitations: Only the listed arrow commands; Example: ``x \\mapsto f(x)``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\in``、``\\notin``、``\\subset``、``\\subseteq``、``\\cup``、``\\cap``、``\\emptyset``、``\\forall``、``\\exists``、``\\infty``;"
" 参数：无; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：仅列出的集合与逻辑符号; 示例：``x \\in A``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\in``, ``\\notin``, ``\\subset``, ``\\subseteq``, "
"``\\cup``, ``\\cap``, ``\\emptyset``, ``\\forall``, ``\\exists``, "
"``\\infty``; Parameters: None; Math environment: inline, display; Supported:"
" yes; Limitations: Only the listed set and logic symbols; Example: ``x \\in "
"A``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\left( ... \\right)``、``\\left[ ... \\right]``、``\\left\\{ ... "
"\\right\\}``、``\\left\\langle...\\right\\rangle``、``\\left\\lfloor...\\right\\rfloor``、``\\left\\lceil...\\right\\rceil``、绝对值和范数模板;"
" 参数：一个可编辑数学内容占位符; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：使用成对定界符；不接受未配对的 "
"``\\left``/``\\right``; 示例：``\\left( x+1 \\right)``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\left( ... \\right)``, ``\\left[ ... \\right]``, "
"``\\left\\{ ... \\right\\}``, ``\\left\\langle...\\right\\rangle``, "
"``\\left\\lfloor...\\right\\rfloor``, ``\\left\\lceil...\\right\\rceil``, "
"absolute-value and norm templates; Parameters: One editable mathematical-"
"content placeholder; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; "
"Limitations: Paired delimiters are required; unmatched "
"``\\left``/``\\right`` are not accepted; Example: ``\\left( x+1 \\right)``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\,``、``\\:``、``\\;``、``\\quad``、``\\qquad``、``\\!``; 参数：无; "
"数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：仅列出的间距命令; 示例：``a\\,b``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\,``, ``\\:``, ``\\;``, ``\\quad``, ``\\qquad``, "
"``\\!``; Parameters: None; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: "
"yes; Limitations: Only the listed spacing commands; Example: ``a\\,b``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\frac``、``\\displaystyle\\frac``; 参数：分子、分母; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; "
"限制：显示分数由 ``\\displaystyle`` 加 ``\\frac`` 表示；目录占位符初始为 ``a``、``b``; "
"示例：``\\frac{a}{b}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\frac``, ``\\displaystyle\\frac``; Parameters: "
"Numerator, denominator; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; "
"Limitations: Display fractions use ``\\displaystyle`` plus ``\\frac``; "
"catalog placeholders initially contain ``a`` and ``b``; Example: "
"``\\frac{a}{b}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\sqrt``、``\\sqrt[n]``; 参数：根指数（可选）、被开方项; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; "
"限制：``ToolArgs.numbered_root`` 为真时普通根式也插入指数占位符; 示例：``\\sqrt[3]{x}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\sqrt``, ``\\sqrt[n]``; Parameters: Root index "
"(optional), radicand; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; "
"Limitations: When ``ToolArgs.numbered_root`` is true, ordinary roots also "
"insert an index placeholder; Example: ``\\sqrt[3]{x}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``^``、``_``; 参数：底项、上标或下标; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; "
"限制：每个可编辑内容单独占位；需要多个字符时用花括号; 示例：``x_{i}^{2}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``^``, ``_``; Parameters: Base, superscript or subscript; "
"Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: Each "
"editable component has its own placeholder; use braces for multiple "
"characters; Example: ``x_{i}^{2}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\sum``、``\\prod``、``\\int``、``\\iint``、``\\iiint``、``\\oint``、``\\lim``;"
" 参数：界限、变量或表达式; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：目录模板提供可编辑界限和主体占位符; 示例：``\\sum_{i=1}^{n} "
"i``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\sum``, ``\\prod``, ``\\int``, ``\\iint``, ``\\iiint``, "
"``\\oint``, ``\\lim``; Parameters: Limits, variable, or expression; Math "
"environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: Catalog templates"
" provide editable placeholders for limits and the body; Example: "
"``\\sum_{i=1}^{n} i``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\sin``、``\\cos``、``\\tan``、``\\log``、``\\ln``、``\\exp``、``\\min``、``\\max``;"
" 参数：函数参数; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：不支持任意用户定义函数名; 示例：``\\sin{x}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\sin``, ``\\cos``, ``\\tan``, ``\\log``, ``\\ln``, "
"``\\exp``, ``\\min``, ``\\max``; Parameters: Function arguments; Math "
"environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: Arbitrary user-"
"defined function names are unsupported; Example: ``\\sin{x}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``matrix``、``pmatrix``、``bmatrix`` 环境; 参数：行、列; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; "
"限制：每个单元格有独立占位符；每个方向最多 16 格；缺省为 2×2; 示例：``\\begin{pmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & "
"d\\end{pmatrix}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``matrix``, ``pmatrix``, ``bmatrix`` environments; "
"Parameters: Rows, columns; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: "
"yes; Limitations: Each cell has its own placeholder; at most 16 cells in "
"each direction; defaults to 2×2; Example: ``\\begin{pmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & "
"d\\end{pmatrix}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``cases`` 环境; 参数：分段行与单元格; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：使用 ``&`` 分隔列、``\\\\`` "
"分隔行；每个方向最多 16 格; 示例：``\\begin{cases}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{cases}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``cases`` environments; Parameters: Piecewise rows and "
"cells; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: ``&``"
" separates columns and ``\\\\`` separates rows; at most 16 cells in each "
"direction; Example: ``\\begin{cases}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{cases}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``aligned`` 环境; 参数：对齐行和表达式; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：``&`` 为对齐点、``\\\\`` "
"为换行；每个方向最多 16 格; 示例：``\\begin{aligned}a &= b \\\\ c &= d\\end{aligned}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``aligned`` environments; Parameters: Aligned rows and "
"expressions; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations:"
" ``&`` marks alignment points and ``\\\\`` line breaks; at most 16 cells in "
"each direction; Example: ``\\begin{aligned}a &= b \\\\ c &= "
"d\\end{aligned}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\vec``、``\\hat``、``\\overline``; 参数：被修饰项; 数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; "
"限制：每个模板有一个可编辑占位符; 示例：``\\vec{x}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\vec``, ``\\hat``, ``\\overline``; Parameters: Accented "
"content; Math environment: inline, display; Supported: yes; Limitations: "
"Each template has one editable placeholder; Example: ``\\vec{x}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``\\text``、``\\mathrm``、``\\mathbf``、``\\mathit``; 参数：文本或数学内容; "
"数学环境：行内、显示; 支持：是; 限制：选区作为 UTF-8 字节原样包裹；首版不在文本内容中执行宏或外部资源; 示例：``\\text{中文}``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``\\text``, ``\\mathrm``, ``\\mathbf``, ``\\mathit``; "
"Parameters: Text or mathematical content; Math environment: inline, display;"
" Supported: yes; Limitations: The selection is wrapped unchanged as UTF-8 "
"bytes; the first version executes neither macros nor external resources "
"inside text; Example: ``\\text{中文}``"

msgid ""
"命令或工具：``%`` 注释、分组花括号、目录中的未知命令错误标记; 参数：无; 数学环境：编辑器词法分析; 支持：是; "
"限制：注释延续到行末；不支持的命令以错误 token 呈现; 示例：``\\frac{a}{b} % note``"
msgstr ""
"Command or tool: ``%`` comments, grouping braces, and catalog error markers "
"for unknown commands; Parameters: None; Math environment: editor lexical "
"analysis; Supported: yes; Limitations: Comments extend to the end of the "
"line; unsupported commands appear as error tokens; Example: ``\\frac{a}{b} %"
" note``"

msgid ""
"目录共有 131 个稳定键。每项都包含英文 ``msgid``、分类、命令、插入模板、参数说明和帮助示例。``catalog_search()`` "
"对这些字段进行 ASCII 不区分大小写的子串搜索；``complete_command()`` 按反斜杠命令前缀补全。完整静态语料见 "
"``tests/fixtures/reliefmath/formulas.tsv``，每个目录键恰好出现一次。"
msgstr ""
"The catalog has 131 stable keys. Every item includes an English ``msgid``, "
"category, command, insertion template, parameter descriptions, and help "
"examples. ``catalog_search()`` performs ASCII case-insensitive substring "
"searches across these fields; ``complete_command()`` completes backslash-"
"command prefixes. The full static corpus is in "
"``tests/fixtures/reliefmath/formulas.tsv``, with each catalog key appearing "
"exactly once."

msgid ""
"``build_snippet()`` 产生 LaTeX 源码和 UTF-8 字节半开区间占位符。无参数符号允许零 stops；带参数结构必须提供非空 "
"stops，且每个区间都包含完整的非空 UTF-8 占位文本。Tab 与 Shift-Tab "
"顺序选择占位符，到达末端或没有占位符时把按键交还给普通焦点导航。编辑核心的单次文本替换（包括一次 IME "
"commit）作为一个撤销单元；占位范围随插入移动，删除与编辑相交的占位符会使其失效。撤销栈保留最近 64 个编辑快照。"
msgstr ""
"``build_snippet()`` produces LaTeX source and UTF-8 byte half-open "
"placeholder ranges. Symbols without parameters may have zero stops; "
"parameterized structures must have nonempty stops, each containing complete,"
" nonempty UTF-8 placeholder text. Tab and Shift-Tab select placeholders in "
"sequence, handing keys back to ordinary focus navigation at the end or when "
"none exist. A single text replacement in the editing core, including one IME"
" commit, is one undo unit. Placeholder ranges move with insertion; deletion "
"and edits intersecting a placeholder invalidate it. The undo stack retains "
"the last 64 edit snapshots."

msgid ""
"源码、查找文本、替换文本以及编辑结果最多为 65536 个 UTF-8 字节；超限返回 ``Code::Limit``。C "
"字符串入口只检查上限内的字节和一个终止位置，替换与拼接在分配结果缓冲前检查最终长度。snippet 每次追加先检查上限，临时源码缓冲容量最多为 "
"65537 字节（含终止符）。失败编辑保留正文、占位符与撤销历史。"
msgstr ""
"Source, find text, replacement text, and edit results are limited to 65536 "
"UTF-8 bytes; exceeding the limit returns ``Code::Limit``. C-string entry "
"points inspect only bytes within the limit and one terminator position. "
"Replacement and concatenation check final length before allocating the "
"result buffer. Each snippet append first checks the limit; temporary source "
"buffers allow at most 65537 bytes including the terminator. Failed edits "
"preserve text, placeholders, and undo history."

msgid ""
"静态工具目录与编辑核心不依赖 FLTK。GUI 收藏采用独立 ``.rmath`` 文档，通过后台 IoJob "
"保存、加载和删除；保存失败可重试，并保留当前公式文档。"
msgstr ""
"The static tool catalog and editing core do not depend on FLTK. GUI "
"favorites use a separate ``.rmath`` document, saved, loaded, and deleted "
"through background IoJob operations. Failed saves can be retried while "
"preserving the current formula document."

msgid ""
"拒绝项：宏定义与重定义：``\\newcommand``、``\\renewcommand``、``\\def``、``\\gdef``、``\\xdef``;"
" 支持：否; 原因或行为：用户输入宏会改变后续语义，首版不展开、不执行宏; 示例：``\\newcommand{\\foo}{x}``"
msgstr ""
"Rejected: Macro definitions/redefinitions: ``\\newcommand``, "
"``\\renewcommand``, ``\\def``, ``\\gdef``, ``\\xdef``; Supported: no; Reason"
" or behavior: User macros change subsequent semantics; the first version "
"neither expands nor executes them; Example: ``\\newcommand{\\foo}{x}``"

msgid ""
"拒绝项：宏包加载：``\\usepackage``; 支持：否; 原因或行为：不加载用户包或修改渲染环境; "
"示例：``\\usepackage{amsmath}``"
msgstr ""
"Rejected: Package loading: ``\\usepackage``; Supported: no; Reason or "
"behavior: No user packages are loaded and the rendering environment is not "
"modified; Example: ``\\usepackage{amsmath}``"

msgid ""
"拒绝项：外部资源：``\\input``、``\\include``、``\\includegraphics``; 支持：否; "
"原因或行为：不读取文件、图片或其他外部数据; 示例：``\\input{file.tex}``"
msgstr ""
"Rejected: External resources: ``\\input``, ``\\include``, "
"``\\includegraphics``; Supported: no; Reason or behavior: Files, images, and"
" other external data are not read; Example: ``\\input{file.tex}``"

msgid ""
"拒绝项：未列出的命令和环境（例如 ``array``、``equation``、``gather``、``tikzpicture``）; 支持：否; "
"原因或行为：未知命令或环境必须显式报错，不静默忽略; 示例：``\\begin{tikzpicture}...``"
msgstr ""
"Rejected: Unlisted commands and environments (for example ``array``, "
"``equation``, ``gather``, ``tikzpicture``); Supported: no; Reason or "
"behavior: Unknown commands or environments must produce explicit errors, "
"never be silently ignored; Example: ``\\begin{tikzpicture}...``"
